<!-- wp:column {"width":"62%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:62%"><!-- wp:details {"className":"therapy-faq-item","style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"var:preset|color|rule","style":"solid","width":"1px"},"top":[],"right":[],"left":[]},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}},"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"500"}},"fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details therapy-faq-item has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="border-bottom-color:var(--wp--preset--color--rule);border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500"><summary>How does the coaching process work?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":"1.65","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"12px","bottom":"0"}}},"textColor":"paragraph-text","fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<p class="has-paragraph-text-color has-text-color has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">We begin with a free discovery call so we can assess fit and discuss what you're hoping to work on. From there, you'll choose a program, receive access to your dashboard, and book your first session. Sessions are held weekly or bi-weekly depending on your plan.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"className":"therapy-faq-item","style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"var:preset|color|rule","style":"solid","width":"1px"},"top":[],"right":[],"left":[]},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details therapy-faq-item" style="border-bottom-color:var(--wp--preset--color--rule);border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>How do I book my sessions?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":"1.65","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"12px","bottom":"0"}}},"textColor":"paragraph-text","fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<p class="has-paragraph-text-color has-text-color has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">Sessions are booked directly through your AllCoach dashboard. Once you enroll, you'll see an integrated calendar where you can select a time that works for you — no back-and-forth emails needed.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"className":"therapy-faq-item","style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"var:preset|color|rule","style":"solid","width":"1px"},"top":[],"right":[],"left":[]},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details therapy-faq-item" style="border-bottom-color:var(--wp--preset--color--rule);border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>What are your qualifications?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":"1.65","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"12px","bottom":"0"}}},"textColor":"paragraph-text","fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<p class="has-paragraph-text-color has-text-color has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">I hold an MA in Clinical Psychology and a Licensed Mental Health Counselor credential (LMHC). I'm also a Professional Certified Coach through the ICF and have completed specialized training in trauma-informed care and the Gottman Method. I've been in practice for 12 years with over 1,200 clients.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"className":"therapy-faq-item","style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"var:preset|color|rule","style":"solid","width":"1px"},"top":[],"right":[],"left":[]},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details therapy-faq-item" style="border-bottom-color:var(--wp--preset--color--rule);border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>Do you offer sliding-scale or reduced fees?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":"1.65","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"12px","bottom":"0"}}},"textColor":"paragraph-text","fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<p class="has-paragraph-text-color has-text-color has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">I keep a small number of sliding-scale spots for clients who need them. Reach out before enrolling and we'll talk about it honestly — cost shouldn't be the reason you don't begin.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"className":"therapy-faq-item","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details therapy-faq-item" style="padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>Is this therapy or coaching — and what's the difference?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"lineHeight":"1.65","fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"400"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"12px","bottom":"0"}}},"textColor":"paragraph-text","fontSize":"body-md","fontFamily":"inter"} -->
<p class="has-paragraph-text-color has-text-color has-inter-font-family has-body-md-font-size" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65">Both. Therapy focuses on healing — understanding and processing past experiences, mental health, and emotional regulation. Coaching focuses on growth — goals, habits, accountability, and forward movement. My programs blend both intentionally, depending on what you need most.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></div>
